  "id": "css-cascade-scope",
  "support": "y",
  "note": "Scope roots, `to (...)` limits, `:scope` and `&` inside, and `@scope` nested in a style rule all work, and the root adds no specificity. When two scopes tie on specificity, the later rule wins: the nearer root is not preferred.",
