 {
  "id": "css-math-functions",
  "support": "a",
  "note": "`min()`, `max()` and `clamp()` compare lengths, percentages and sums of both in sizes, margins, padding, insets and gaps: `padding: clamp(1rem, 5%, 3rem)`, `margin-inline: max(1rem, (100% - 60rem) / 2)`, `width: clamp(200px, 50% + 2rem, 800px)`, `width: calc(min(100%, 600px) - 2rem)`. Two arguments that both need the percentage basis compare only when they share their length, as in `min(10%, 20%)`; `min(10%, 5% + 20px)` is dropped, as is a fourth distinct pair of bounds on one element. `sin()`, `cos()`, `tan()`, `asin()`, `acos()`, `atan()`, `atan2()`, `pow()`, `sqrt()`, `log()` and `exp()` work over constants, such as `calc(sin(30deg) * 100px)`. `round()`, `mod()`, `rem()`, `abs()`, `sign()` and `hypot()` also take `em`, `rem`, viewport units and mixed units, such as `round(up, 2.3em, 4px)`; with a percentage in them the declaration is dropped.",
  "probes": [
   {
    "sheet": ".sample{margin-left:max(1em, 30px)}"
   },
   {
    "sheet": ".sample{width:min(200px, 120px)}"
   },
   {
    "sheet": ".sample{width:clamp(50px, 20px, 90px)}"
   },
   {
    "sheet": ".sample{margin-left:calc(sin(30deg) * 60px)}"
   },
   {
    "sheet": ".sample{width:calc(pow(2, 3) * 10px)}"
   },
   {
    "sheet": ".sample{width:round(up, 113px, 20px)}"
   },
   {
    "sheet": ".sample{width:min(50%, 120px)}"
   },
   {
    "sheet": ".sample{width:min(50%, 300px)}"
   },
   {
    "sheet": ".sample{max-width:max(25%, 40px)}"
   },
   {
    "sheet": ".sample{min-width:max(200%, 40px)}"
   },
   {
    "sheet": ".sample{width:clamp(50px, 50%, 90px)}"
   },
   {
    "sheet": ".sample{width:min(100% - 20px, 600px)}"
   },
   {
    "sheet": ".sample{width:round(up, 10em, 1px)}"
   },
   {
    "sheet": ".sample{margin-left:mod(5em, 30px)}"
   },
   {
    "sheet": ".sample{width:clamp(50px, 50% + 10px, 300px)}"
   },
   {
    "sheet": ".sample{width:calc(min(100%, 300px) - 2em)}"
   },
   {
    "sheet": ".sample{padding-left:max(10%, 30px)}"
   },
   {
    "sheet": ".sample{padding-left:clamp(10px, 5%, 30px)}"
   },
   {
    "sheet": ".sample{margin-left:max(1em, (100% - 300px) / 2)}"
   },
   {
    "sheet": ".sample{column-gap:clamp(4px, 10%, 30px)}",
    "base": ".sample{display:flex}"
   },
   {
    "sheet": ".sample{left:min(10%, 30px)}",
    "base": ".sample{position:relative}"
   }
  ],
